flowchart TB
    subgraph Surface[Conversation surfaces]
        User[User]
        Client[Chat or coding client]
    end

    subgraph Knowledge[Knowledge Loop]
        Ingress[Trusted current-turn ingress]
        Raw[Immutable content-addressed Raw]
        Receipt[Closed turn receipt]
        Notes[Canonical general notes]
        Search[Bounded lexical and evidence retrieval]
        Context[Quote-carrying context]
        NoteUse[Content-free note-use receipt]
        Reflect[Answer and reflection]
        Epoch[Writer epoch gate]
        Tombstone[Legacy tombstone view]
        Wiki[Living Wiki claims]
        Correct[Supersession and correction cases]
        Outcome[Observed outcome cases]
        Eval[Evaluation vectors]
    end

    subgraph Lenses[Derived lenses]
        Markdown[Markdown and Obsidian]
        Graph[Semantic graph]
        Code[Code dependency graph]
    end

    subgraph Actions[Optional Action Loop]
        Lease[Bounded capability]
        Effect[Idempotent effect]
        Reconcile[Receipt and reconciliation]
    end

    User --> Client --> Ingress
    Ingress --> Raw
    Ingress --> Receipt
    Raw --> Search
    Receipt --> Search
    Notes --> Search
    Wiki --> Search --> Context --> Reflect --> Epoch
    Search --> NoteUse
    Stale[Loaded stale client] --> Tombstone -->|refuse| Epoch
    Epoch --> Wiki
    Epoch --> Correct --> Wiki
    Epoch --> Outcome --> Eval
    Eval -. evaluated changes .-> Search
    Wiki -. derived .-> Markdown
    Wiki -. derived .-> Graph
    Reflect -. implementation .-> Code
    Reflect -->|explicit delegation| Lease --> Effect --> Reconcile

    subgraph ProjectKnowledge[Project continuity]
        Originals[Revision-pinned originals]
        Job[Agent-submitted improvement task]
        Worker[Replaceable generator]
        Review[Separate review process]
        Publish[Host publishes derived procedure]
    end
    Originals --> Context
    Reflect -->|measured task failure| Job
    Job -->|later response-end event| Worker --> Review --> Publish
    Publish --> Context
    Body[Dashboard projects and work records] -->|current note lookup and snapshots| Notes
    Body -. planned project context and outcome adapter .-> ProjectKnowledge
